# Evidence stays on the build machine and out of git, as it does out of the handoff zip:
# audit/raw is the untouched live-site capture, audit/rendered the browser-rendered DOM (61 MB),
# audit/css + capture the style harvest, audit/screens the pixel-diff shots (115 MB).
# audit/content-blocks and the inventories ARE committed: build.mjs reads them.
